share_missing — Share of rows where a variable is missing.           functions/clean.zeff · a function of this project

USAGE
    share_missing(data: Frame, var: Var)

DESCRIPTION
    Counts the rows where `var` is `NA` and divides by the row count.

ARGUMENTS
    data    The frame to check.
    var     The variable whose missing values are counted.

VALUE
    Float: The share, a Float between 0 and 1.

EXAMPLES
    > dataset(wages).share_missing(wage)
    0.0114599
